      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm seeing some weird issues on subnet 10.42.0.0/24 here in lyon. getting intermittent packet loss and high jitter on several hops. can u look at this traceroute and tell me if it looks like a hardware fault or just congestion?\n\n1  192.168.1.1  0.421ms  0.415ms  0.430ms\n2  10.50.0.1  12.5ms  45.2ms  15.1ms\n3  172.16.4.22  18.2ms  112.8ms  19.5ms\n4  80.12.44.1  22.1ms  25.4ms  28.9ms\n5  * * * request timed out\n6  80.12.44.1  24.2ms  26.1ms  23.8ms\n\nping stats for hop 3:\nmin/avg/max/mdev = 15.221/68.442/115.890/32.110 ms\npacket loss: 12%",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
