      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i checked the interface stats on 172.16.4.22 and the bandwidth utilization looks fine, well under 50%. it isn't an obvious congestion issue. i'm also seeing some CRC errors on the physical interface of that router. could it be a bad SFP or maybe some EMI? the jitter is really erratic.",
