      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah, i swapped out the SFP and re-seated the fiber, but the CRC errors and the jitter are still there. its almost like it's completely random. sometimes it's fine for an hour then it just goes haywire. any other ideas? could it be something deeper in the logic or just some weird ghost in the machine?",
